-（引擎轰鸣）
-（哨声长鸣）
-(ENGINE REVVING)
-(BLARING)

1111
00:53:06,167 --> 00:53:08,267
开球了！这可是场真正的足球赛！
We're off!
It's a game of football!

1112
00:53:08,300 --> 00:53:10,867
“巴西军团”的技术优势立刻显露无遗。
The Brazilian skill
was immediately obvious.

1113
00:53:10,900 --> 00:53:12,700
（轮胎尖叫）
(TYRES SCREECHING)

1114
00:53:12,733 --> 00:53:14,933
但AYGO队的手感也丝毫不减当年。
But the AYGOs
hadn't lost their touch.

1115
00:53:14,967 --> 00:53:17,533
梅：1号梅选手的漂亮盘带！
MAY: Fantastic dribbling
by May, Number 1!

1116
00:53:18,633 --> 00:53:20,433
梅直奔球门去了！
May's on for the goal!

1117
00:53:20,467 --> 00:53:23,200
哈蒙德：
不过“巴西队”块头更大，
铲抢凶狠。
HAMMOND:
The Brazilians, though,
were bigger and tackled hard.

1118
00:53:24,000 --> 00:53:26,200
你犯规了！
You fouled!

1119
00:53:26,233 --> 00:53:29,667
但最终，
AYGO的轻巧灵动
还是大放异彩。
But eventually
the AYGO agility
shone through.

1120
00:53:29,700 --> 00:53:32,633
噢，老王牌班底发威了！我们把他们压得死死的！
Oh, this is the old firm
in action. We're all over 'em.

1121
00:53:32,667 --> 00:53:34,167
像廉价西装一样死死贴着。
Like cheap suits.

1122
00:53:34,167 --> 00:53:35,833
传给2号！
Pass to number 2.

1123
00:53:35,867 --> 00:53:37,367
他找到空档了！
He's found the gap!

1124
00:53:39,700 --> 00:53:41,167
进了！（轻笑）
Yes! (CHUCKLES)

1125
00:53:41,600 --> 00:53:42,833
不——！
No!

1126
00:53:42,867 --> 00:53:45,400
捷克队这位选手
太神了！
What a player
from the Czech Republic there.

1127
00:53:45,433 --> 00:53:47,267
（听不清）
(INDISTINCT)

1128
00:53:47,300 --> 00:53:50,033
伙计，这记配合进球
简直堪称艺术。
That, mate, was a magnificent
choreographed goal.

1129
00:53:50,067 --> 00:53:52,533
没错，没错。太漂亮了。
Yes, yes. Yes, yes.

1130
00:53:54,067 --> 00:53:56,333
别慌，巴西队，
咱们可别灰心丧气。
Don't worry, Brazil,
let's not be down-hearted.

1131
00:53:56,367 --> 00:53:59,900
咱们优点多着呢，
只是起步加速
不在此列罢了。
We have good qualities.
Just speed off the line
isn't one of them.

1132
00:54:02,500 --> 00:54:05,200
哈蒙德：
而AYGO队
充分利用了这一点。
HAMMOND:
And the AYGOs took
full advantage of this fact.

1133
00:54:05,233 --> 00:54:06,433
漂亮！
Nice!

1134
00:54:06,467 --> 00:54:08,533
迅速把比分
改写为2比0。
Bringing the score
quickly to 2-0.

1135
00:54:10,700 --> 00:54:12,167
梅：漂亮！
MAY: Yes!

1136
00:54:12,667 --> 00:54:14,500
开起来太灵巧了。
It's so chuckable.

1137
00:54:14,533 --> 00:54:17,367
就像开着一列
带轮子的火车一样听话。
It's like having a train
with wheels on it.

1138
00:54:17,867 --> 00:54:19,167
（按喇叭）
(HONKING)

1139
00:54:19,167 --> 00:54:21,200
哈蒙德：我的巴西Fox队
以0比2落后，
HAMMOND: With my Brazilian
Foxes 2-0 down

1140
00:54:21,233 --> 00:54:24,467
随着半场临近，
大家的火气开始上来了。
as the interval approached,
tempers started to get frayed.

1141
00:54:26,333 --> 00:54:27,467
哎哟！（哔——）
Ooh! (BLEEP)

1142
00:54:30,833 --> 00:54:32,167
哎哟！
Ooh!

1143
00:54:32,867 --> 00:54:34,500
（撞击声）
(CRASHES)

1144
00:54:34,533 --> 00:54:36,300
-不过等半场号角吹响，
-（喇叭长鸣）
- But when the horn went.
-(HORN BLARING)

1145
00:54:36,333 --> 00:54:39,033
比分依然维持在2比0，
The score was still 2-0,

1146
00:54:39,067 --> 00:54:40,867
AYGO队这边
乐翻了天。
leaving the AYGOs
over the moon.

1147
00:54:40,900 --> 00:54:42,567
干得漂亮。
Lovely work.

1148
00:54:42,600 --> 00:54:45,167
而Fox队这边
垂头丧气、如丧考妣，
诸如此类等等等等。
And the Foxes
sick as parrots
etcetera, etcetera.

1149
00:54:46,967 --> 00:54:50,600
不过，中场休息正好可以瞧瞧
这几台车被折腾成什么样了。
Still, the interval
was a good time to see
how the cars were faring.

1150
00:54:51,900 --> 00:54:54,567
他的变速挡把都断了。
His gear lever has come off.

1151
00:54:54,600 --> 00:54:56,200
这确实挺让人头疼的。
That's a worry, I suppose.

1152
00:54:56,233 --> 00:54:58,400
大概是为了省成本
偷工减料了吧。
Maybe it's built down
to a price.

1153
00:54:58,433 --> 00:55:01,367
哈蒙德：我正带球狂奔呢你撞我！
梅：我哪有。
HAMMOND: You rammed me
while I was on a run!
MAY: I didn't.

1154
00:55:01,400 --> 00:55:04,300
我再说一遍，那绝对是
一次极具水准的漂亮滑铲。
Once again that was
a superb sliding tackle.

1155
00:55:04,333 --> 00:55:07,300
噢，不好意思。
哎呀，我这就……
Oh, I'm sorry.
Oh, dear, I'll just...

1156
00:55:07,333 --> 00:55:09,400
差距显而易见了吧。
You can see the difference.

1157
00:55:09,433 --> 00:55:12,167
瞧，这台基本
就没怎么变形。
Look. This one isn't
really deformed.

1158
00:55:12,167 --> 00:55:14,167
所以说，AYGO很皮实耐造，这大家心里都有数。
So, I mean, these AYGOs
are tough, we know that.

1159
00:55:14,167 --> 00:55:17,333
-AYGO确实是非常、非常
抗造的小车，不过……
-（清嗓子）
-The AYGOs are very, very
tough little car, but...
-(CLEARS THROAT)

1160
00:55:17,367 --> 00:55:19,567
-好吧，确实掉了那么一块。
-除了那块，
它好得很。
-Yeah. Well, there's that bit.
-Apart from that,
that is fine.

1161
00:55:19,600 --> 00:55:21,667
HAMMOND:
詹姆斯不仅蛮横霸道，
HAMMOND:
Not only was James bolshie,

1162
00:55:21,700 --> 00:55:23,267
还一点体育道德都不讲。
he was also unsporting.

1163
00:55:23,300 --> 00:55:24,400
（漏气声）
(AIR HISSES)

1164
00:55:25,333 --> 00:55:27,333
喂！你个作弊的大……
Oi! You cheating great...

1165
00:55:30,300 --> 00:55:32,500
HAMMOND:
下半场……
HAMMOND:
The second half...

1166
00:55:32,533 --> 00:55:35,500
天哪，我的Fox队
面临的可是场硬仗。
And boy, did my Foxes
have a mountain to climb.

1167
00:55:38,167 --> 00:55:40,333
MAY: 漂亮的拦截。
MAY: Lovely interception.

1168
00:55:46,167 --> 00:55:49,000
HAMMOND: 突然间，
上帝之手显灵，
HAMMOND: Suddenly
the hand of God intervened

1169
00:55:49,033 --> 00:55:51,167
天上倾盆大雨倾泻而下。
and the heavens opened.

1170
00:55:55,167 --> 00:55:59,533
湿滑的球场开始
偏向更重、
更皮实的巴西产Fox。
The wet pitch started
to favour the heavier,
tougher Brazilians.

1171
00:56:02,533 --> 00:56:03,600
漂亮！
Good work!

1172
00:56:06,033 --> 00:56:09,500
2号车一路狂飙，
甩开了AYGO。
Number 2 brushed off the AYGOs
with a scorching run.

1173
00:56:10,333 --> 00:56:12,000
（喇叭齐鸣）
(HORNS HONKING)

1174
00:56:14,433 --> 00:56:15,633
（狂笑）
(CACKLES)

1175
00:56:18,300 --> 00:56:20,533
Fox队冲起来了。
Foxes on a run.

1176
00:56:20,567 --> 00:56:24,167
HAMMOND:
没错，我的Fox队
终于找回状态了。
HAMMOND:
Yes, my Foxes were
finally into their stride.

1177
00:56:24,200 --> 00:56:26,667
他们迅速打入一球，
扳平了比分。
They quickly banged home
the equaliser.

1178
00:56:26,700 --> 00:56:27,933
不！
No!

1179
00:56:28,533 --> 00:56:29,633
太棒了！
Yes!

1180
00:56:33,033 --> 00:56:35,567
紧接着，
由于AYGO犯规……
And then
following an AYGO foul...

1181
00:56:35,600 --> 00:56:37,733
噢，撞得真够狠的！
Oh, that was a big crash!

1182
00:56:37,767 --> 00:56:39,367
我们获得了一记任意球。
We were given a free kick.

1183
00:56:42,267 --> 00:56:43,633
并且以3比2反超！
And took a 3-2 lead.

1184
00:56:43,667 --> 00:56:45,733
不要啊！
No!

1185
00:56:45,767 --> 00:56:49,367
HAMMOND: 随着比赛结束临近，
场上的火药味
彻底浓了起来。
HAMMOND: With full time
approaching fast,
the game really hotted up.

1186
00:56:50,767 --> 00:56:53,067
HAMMOND:
嗷！这动作太脏了。
HAMMOND:
Ow! That was dirty play.

1187
00:56:53,167 --> 00:56:54,733
甚至还爆发了冲突，
A fight even broke out

1188
00:56:54,767 --> 00:56:56,567
詹姆斯成了挨揍的活靶子。
with James bearing the brunt.

1189
00:56:56,600 --> 00:56:58,000
-（重重撞击声）
-噢！
-(THUDS)
-Oh!

1190
00:56:59,533 --> 00:57:00,967
（奸笑）
(CACKLING)

1191
00:57:02,567 --> 00:57:03,933
哎哟喂！
Oh, dear!

1192
00:57:03,967 --> 00:57:05,900
HAMMOND: 这场混战让
“韦恩”·梅负伤了。
HAMMOND: The scrap left
"Wayne" May injured.

1193
00:57:05,933 --> 00:57:07,800
MAY: 把我跖骨都干裂了。
MAY: Broken me metatarsal.

1194
00:57:07,833 --> 00:57:09,500
啊，这下舒坦了。
Ah, that's better.

1195
00:57:09,533 --> 00:57:13,200
HAMMOND:
但这反而彻底激起了
AYGO队的斗志。
HAMMOND:
But this only spurred
the AYGOs on.

1196
00:57:13,233 --> 00:57:15,600
就在比赛只剩几分钟时……
And with just minutes to go...

1197
00:57:17,033 --> 00:57:18,433
他们扳平了比分。
They equalised.

1198
00:57:18,467 --> 00:57:19,933
太棒了！
Oh, yes!

1199
00:57:19,967 --> 00:57:23,533
哈哈哈！这球堪比1966年英格兰……
快闭嘴吧。
Ha, ha, ha! It's worthy
of the England 1960...
Oh, shut up.

1200
00:57:23,567 --> 00:57:27,567
我们现在真得加把劲拿出真本事了。
We really do need to
pull our fingers out here.

1201
00:57:27,600 --> 00:57:30,600
此时比分战成3比3，
终场哨声
吹响在即，
The score now at 3-3
and the final
whistle imminent,

1202
00:57:30,633 --> 00:57:34,167
灵活的AYGO围攻了
Fox的球门。
the agile AYGOs were all over
the Foxes' goalmouth.

1203
00:57:36,000 --> 00:57:37,433
哈蒙德：别啊！
HAMMOND: No!

1204
00:57:43,067 --> 00:57:46,033
我们唯一的胜算
就是把它们
撞飞出去。
Our only chance
was to smash them
out of the way.

1205
00:57:48,667 --> 00:57:51,467
边路成了我和4号AYGO
单挑的局面。
It was me versus AYGO 4
down the wing.

1206
00:57:51,500 --> 00:57:52,600
哈蒙德：冲啊，宝贝！
HAMMOND: Come on, baby!

1207
00:57:54,600 --> 00:57:55,733
我把球给丢了。
I'd lost the ball.

1208
00:57:55,767 --> 00:57:56,933
该死！
Damn!

1209
00:57:56,967 --> 00:57:59,167
但6号车
不知从哪儿杀了过来。
But number 6
came out of nowhere.

1210
00:58:01,467 --> 00:58:02,767
太棒了！
Yes!

1211
00:58:02,800 --> 00:58:04,633
-（喇叭齐鸣）
-哦，惨了！
-(BLARING)
-Oh, no!

1212
00:58:04,667 --> 00:58:05,700
（欢呼尖叫）
(WHOOPING)

1213
00:58:08,167 --> 00:58:09,567
讨厌的小矮子。
Odious little man.

1214
00:58:09,600 --> 00:58:11,033
我们赢啦！
We are the winners!

1215
00:58:15,533 --> 00:58:17,267
（观众鼓掌）
(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

1216
00:58:20,533 --> 00:58:21,800
我觉得……
I think...

1217
00:58:21,833 --> 00:58:23,933
说实话，看完了这场比赛
谁还提得起兴致
I honestly can't see
how anybody's gonna bother

1218
00:58:23,967 --> 00:58:25,433
去看真正的世界杯啊。
watching a real World Cup
after that.

1219
00:58:25,467 --> 00:58:27,033
这比赛好看太多了。
It was just
a better spectacle.

1220
00:58:27,067 --> 00:58:28,600
绝对的。
正经球赛无聊透顶。
Absolutely.
The real thing's dull.

1221
00:58:28,633 --> 00:58:31,800
-你干嘛呢？
-我收到短信了！
-What're you doing?
-I've got a text!

1222
00:58:31,833 --> 00:58:33,033
-克里斯汀发来的？
-对。
-From Kristin?
-Yes.

1223
00:58:33,067 --> 00:58:35,600
-真的假的？
-真的，你瞧。
-Really?
-Yes. Here it is.

1224
00:58:35,633 --> 00:58:37,167
念出来听听。
Go on, then.

1225
00:58:38,067 --> 00:58:41,033
呃……嗯。上面写着，
Er... Um. It says,

1226
00:58:41,067 --> 00:58:43,367
“你应该知道
那张人身限制令吧……”
"You know about
the restraining order..."

1227
00:58:43,400 --> 00:58:44,667
（观众大笑）
(AUDIENCE LAUGHING)

1228
00:58:44,700 --> 00:58:47,933
“……限制令也包括短信。
我要报警了。”
"That includes texts.
I'm calling the police."

1229
00:58:49,567 --> 00:58:52,933
伴随着这颗重磅炸弹，
本期节目也到了尾声。
And on that bombshell
it's time to end.

1230
00:58:52,967 --> 00:58:55,467
遗憾的是接下来的五周里
我们将暂别荧屏，
Sadly for the next five weeks
we won't be here

1231
00:58:55,500 --> 00:58:57,967
因为我们得给
韦恩·鲁尼的大耳朵让路了。
cos we're making way
for Wayne Rooney's ears.

1232
00:58:58,000 --> 00:58:59,200
（众人大笑）
(ALL LAUGHING)

1233
00:58:59,233 --> 00:59:01,167
但我们七月就会回归，
届时再会！
But we'll be back in July
so see you then!

1234
00:59:01,167 --> 00:59:02,967
感谢收看！
晚安！
Thanks for watching!
Goodnight!

1235
00:59:03,000 --> 00:59:04,633
（观众鼓掌）
(AUDIENCE APPLAUDING)

